                      "Corn Chips":  "r100 widget-map precedent (Corn Chips -\u003e potato-chips): same-class salty-bag fold at the same price class. The corn-chips -\u003e tortilla-chips rejection stands; this is a different, already-verified fold.",
                      "Ricotta Cheese":  "Follows the verified r100 widget-map precedent (Ricotta -\u003e cottage-cheese, same price class ~$0.12-0.16/oz). Concept stretch flagged for the match-soundness gate - happy to null it if the gate disagrees.",
                      "Gingersnap Cookies":  "cookies commodity = packaged cookies at the same price class (Butter Crackers -\u003e crackers precedent).",
                      "Tortilla":  "Board \u0027tortillas\u0027 price is PER TORTILLA ($0.106 each), gpu 45 g = one 8-inch flour tortilla. This is the r100 16x-lesson case done right.",
                      "Sandwich Bread":  "bread each = one loaf; gpu 567 g = 20 oz cheapest-mainline white loaf class.",
                      "Kale":  "kale each = one bunch; gpu 250 g is a bounded estimate (200-300 g range) - flagged in decisions.json.",
                      "Sweet Soy Sauce":  "gpu 38 g/floz = 29.57 x 1.3 density (kecap manis is a syrup, NOT water-like).",
                      "Apple Juice":  "water-like convention 29.57 (true 30.8); matches Apple Cider/Pineapple Juice precedent in ingredient-map (Orange Juice\u0027s 31 is the outlier)."
